---
description: >-
  Data labels with no y-axis range given (#537, D611). The inferred range
  starts at the lowest value, so the 10 bar is only a few px high and has
  no room for its label: it gets none, and the 30 and 11 bars are labelled
  at the size that fits the 11 bar. No XYCHART_LABEL_TOO_SMALL warning.
  Horizontal counterpart: data-labels-auto-range-horizontal.mmd.
config:
  xyChart:
    showDataLabel: true
---
xychart
  bar [10, 30, 11]
